  "description": "Operating Area: Summer - French Riviera, Corsica, Naples & Amalfi Coast, Sicily, Sardinia, Marseille to Saint Tropez, Tuscany & Elba / Winter - British Virgin Islands, Grenadines Islands, Antigua & Barbuda, Martinique & Guadeloupe, Saint Martin & Saint Barth\n\nBase port : Olbia, Sardinia\n\nHOUBARA is a 23.99m / 79ft Catamaran Luxury Yacht built in 2012 by Sunreef Yachts with interior design by Sunreef Yachts and later underwent a refit in 2026. Sleeping 6 guests in 3 cabins and with a crew of 3. Cruising at 9.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 18.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise of a Master cabin, a queen cabin and a twin cabin convertible to a double cabin with additional pullman bed.",
